/// \brief		
///				// 2007-12-04 by cmkwon, żą´ç Ľ±ą°ÇĎ±â ¶óŔĚşę·Ż¸® ĽöÁ¤ - CashItem_Yedang() ŔÎŔÚ Ăß°ˇ, UID32_t i_giveTargetCharUID=0
/// \author		cmkwon
