/// \fn			void CFieldIOCPSocket::WatchReady()
/// \brief		°üŔü ˝ĂŔŰ Ŕüżˇ ÁŘşń »çÇ×.
/// \author		dhjin
/// \date		2007-06-15 ~ 2007-06-15
/// \warning	
